{"parse":{"title":"2026年1月8日维护内容","pageid":7458,"revid":18562,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B41%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B41%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B41%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF\" title=\"铃兰资讯\">铃兰资讯</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"维护\">维护</a> &gt; <b>2026年1月8日维护内容</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8B1.E6.9C.888.E6.97.A5.E7.BB.B4.E6.8A.A4.E5.86.85.E5.AE.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容\">《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B41%E6%9C%888%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2026-01-07<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F758020903844972302\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/758020903844972302</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin: 20px 0 -15px 0; font-weight: normal; margin-left:0px;\"><img alt=\"笔记.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/40px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/60px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/80px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />【更新内容】</div>\n<p><br />\n1.「<font color=\"#54b4db\">命运之子</font>」联动限定邂逅\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/01/09&#160;12:00&#160;-&#160;2026/01/22&#160;23:59\n<br />✦首次10连5折优惠 \n<br /><br />\n2.「<font color=\"#f3c156\">利维亚的杰洛特</font>」联动限定邂逅返场\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/01/09&#160;12:00&#160;-&#160;2026/01/22&#160;23:59\n<br /><br />\n3.「<font color=\"#d68fe2\">黑发的女术士</font>」联动限定邂逅返场\n<br />▶︎&#160;活动时间：\n<br />2026/01/09&#160;12:00&#160;-&#160;2026/01/22&#160;23:59\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<br />\n【战斗】修复了「基安希尔」释放技能「不朽·铁血开拓」时，召唤「帝国不朽军」的位置可能不正确的问题。<br />【战斗】修复了个别情况下「叶奈法」的「幻象」异常无法消失的问题。<br />【患者的旅程】修复了高难关卡「3-1」的失败条件描述不正确的问题。<br />【系统】在材料不足时，优化了「综合自选宝箱」的使用逻辑。<br />【狩猎森林之主】修正了「妖灵」个性「冥炎污痕」的描述，补充增加免疫「冥炎之径」，实际效果不受影响。<br />【狩猎森林之主】修正了「灵体闪袭」中「射程」显示不正确的问题，实际效果不受影响。<br />【秘境探险】修复了「三色灵药」效果可能未正常生效问题。<br />【秘境探险】修复了「蓝色魔药」效果可能未正常生效问题。<br />【交汇的航迹】优化了任务「异界奇兵·关卡3」的描述，使之没有歧义。<br />【交汇的航迹】修复了「暗鸦风暴·改」中「裂伤」效果持续回合不正确的问题。<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164211\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1902/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 234/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.963      1 -total\n 57.15%   21.126      1 模板:文章戳\n 42.57%   15.734      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7458-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164211 and revision id 18562. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"维护","missing":true}],"images":["笔记.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"2026年1月8日维护内容","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容"}],"displaytitle":"2026年1月8日维护内容","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|维护}}\n=《铃兰之剑》1月8日维护内容=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=维护\n|时间=2026-01-07\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/758020903844972302\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<d